What this license covers

The MIT License above applies to the contents of this repository: the
documentation, the client configuration files, the request examples and the
registry metadata.

It does not cover the data the servers return, and it does not grant any
rights to the services at since98.vn:

- Address data comes from the administrative-unit transition table published
  by the National Statistics Office of Viet Nam (Cục Thống kê) and from the
  resolutions of the National Assembly Standing Committee. Official documents
  belong to their publishers; check their terms before reusing them in bulk.
- Payroll parameters are taken from laws, decrees and circulars of Viet Nam as
  published on official government portals.
- Zalo prices, rules and error codes are taken from pages published by Zalo.
  Zalo is a trademark of its owner. The Zalo reference tool is independent and
  not affiliated with Zalo or VNG.

Our own selection, structure and wording of the answers is provided for
reference. Access to the servers is free under the published rate limit and
may change. For bulk use or an integration, write to hello@since98.vn.
